Ramachandran contour grids (Top8000)
====================================

Six 180x180 grids (general, glycine, cispro, transpro, prepro, ileval), 2-degree bins
centred at odd degrees (-179 ... 179), row index = phi bin, column index = psi bin,
little-endian IEEE-754 f32, values in [0, 1]. Generated by scripts/convert_rama8000.py
from

  cctbx_project/mmtbx/validation/ramachandran/rama8000_tables.h
  https://github.com/cctbx/cctbx_project

