The underlying distributions are from the Top8000 dataset (Richardson laboratory,
Duke University): Lovell et al. 2003, Proteins 50:437; Chen et al. 2010, Acta Cryst
D66:12. Evaluation (bin selection, bilinear interpolation and the favored/allowed
thresholds) replicates mmtbx/validation/ramachandran/rama_eval.h and
mmtbx/validation/ramalyze.py so that results match MolProbity's ramalyze.
